From e5609bf2a3882c81676b2dfa777844c99efdc80d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 04 Oct 2021 20:00:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-52828] boot_if: introduce new apis

Introduce U-Boot like error and device status APIs for use in Preboot.
The new APIs are more clean and easy to use in simple cases.
Switch most of the users to use it.

Change-Id: I9d3eab110886e5c9a8dbf3b831b602ea51fb8c6c
Signed-off-by: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
---

